        "description": "<p style=\"text-align: justify\">This is Middle Ages-style surgery, used to help others recover from physical damage. It encompasses tending and binding wounds of all varieties, and the necessary but brutal skill of cauterization. See page @@ for rules</p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><strong>Specialties:</strong> cauterization, diagnosis, binding wounds, setting bones. (General)</p>",
